# Shared infra repo: jax-free orchestration + HPO engine.
# Per-project HPO data (studies/, runs/, snapshots/) lives under <project>/hpo/,
# NOT here. Keep this repo to scripts + the HPO engine only.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
hpo/.venv/
# Dedicated slim venv (aim only) for the shared Aim tracking server, launched
# from the repo root serving the root .aim repo. See infra/README / env.sh.
.aim-venv/
*.log
